<title>HONG KONG: Kader Holdings 1996 net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Kader Holdings 1996 net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	0.9 gain    vs 3.7 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     5.95 gain   vs 3.80 loss</p>
<p>    Net			 4.70 profit vs 17.99 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		  462.18	vs 376.68</p>
<p>    Company name	    Kader Holdings Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     July 7-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Kader Holdings makes toys.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-10 shares held.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on write back of provisions held against associated companies on their disposal.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
